config HOUJI_CHARGE
	bool "Houji charge boost driver"
	depends on THERMAL && POWER_SUPPLY
	default n
	help
	  Kernel-side charge boost for Xiaomi 14 (houji). Unlocks vendor
	  charge current limits at boot, keeps a 40-50W daily charging
	  target with a temperature closed loop (drop to 30W at >=45C,
	  restore at <=40C), and auto-recovers from ChargingSus stalls
	  via input_suspend pulse. Runtime interface: /proc/houji_charge.